			"date": "2024-10-16T04:15:34.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <br>Also not in web component form but this is my take on a spoiler pattern.</p><p>`visibility: hidden` keeps the content hidden from everyone until it's used.</p><p><a href=\"https://codepen.io/ccwilcox/pen/wvXxzNG\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">codepen.io/ccwilcox/pen/wvXxzN</span><span class=\"invisible\">G</span></a></p><p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.online/@stvfrnzl\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>stvfrnzl</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://a11y.info/@scottohara\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>scottohara</span></a></span></p>",
