			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://c.im/@cwilcox808\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>cwilcox808</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.online/@stvfrnzl\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>stvfrnzl</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://a11y.info/@scottohara\" class=\"u-url mention\">@<span>scottohara</span></a></span> oh my this code would be excellent for a web component (would have the extra benefit of for-free init for any later injected content too)</p>",
