			},
			"date": "2024-10-18T17:26:17.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> <br>I made a fancier light DOM version. Like the Shadow DOM version, you only need to use &lt;spoil-er&gt;, the rest of what is needed is automatically added.</p><p>I think how it adds the button is okay but I'm a little unsure about how it wraps the content in a span.</p><p><a href=\"https://codepen.io/ccwilcox/pen/RwXgGjz\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" translate=\"no\" target=\"_blank\"><span class=\"invisible\">https://</span><span class=\"ellipsis\">codepen.io/ccwilcox/pen/RwXgGj</span><span class=\"invisible\">z</span></a></p><p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.online/@stvfrnzl\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>stvfrnzl</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://a11y.info/@scottohara\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>scottohara</span></a></span></p>",
